# DeepSeek API key for the chatbot (server-side only — NEVER commit a real key)
# Get yours at https://platform.deepseek.com/api_keys
#
# Set this in your hosting provider's environment variables
# (Vercel > Settings > Environment Variables, or Netlify > Environment variables).
# The /api/chat.js function reads it server-side so visitors never see it.
DEEPSEEK_API_KEY=your-deepseek-api-key-here
